<title>USA: Mercantile Stores Co q4 shr $1.70 vs $2.11.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Stores Co q4 shr $1.70 vs $2.11.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Ohio 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Quarter and Year Ended</p>
<p>			   February 1, 1997 and February 3, 1996</p>
<p>			   (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			   Feb 1,     Feb 3,	Feb 1,     Feb 3,</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	  1997	 1996</p>
<p>			 (13 wks)   (14 wks) (52 wks)(A)   (53 wks)</p>
<p> Total Revs     $ 988,145  $ 1,004,253 $ 3,030,822 $ 2,944,324</p>
