<p>   Total		   1.70	 2.11	  3.30	 3.35</p>
<p>Note:  (A) - The February 1, 1997 fifty-two weeks reflects a pre-tax charge totaling $12 million, or $.20 per share, attributable to the adoption of a new accounting standard related to the impairment of long-lived assets.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
